                                                "sense_id": "5863401e-1d16-3144-a4ca-d56a0cade554",
                                                "text": "\"Major refurbishments will be made over the next ten years. We have nine wooden viaducts along the line - it's an ongoing programme,\" he says."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "69f701e3-8c82-3d4f-8212-0f3c594acb20",
